#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: zinn-migrate.php
msgid "Zinn® Migrate"
msgstr "Zinn® Migrate"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: zinn-migrate.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate"

#. Description of the plugin
#: zinn-migrate.php
msgid "Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration."
msgstr "Yana tara wannan rukunin yanar gizon WordPress — fayiloli da bayanan bayanai — zuwa cikin jakar ajiya guda ɗaya wacce Zinn Digital® za ta iya jawowa, don masu masaukin baki da ba za mu iya isa gare ta ta wata hanya ba. Sanya shi a kan rukunin yanar gizon da kakeBARI, danna maballin guda ɗaya, kuma manna hanyar haɗin a cikin hijirarka ta Zinn®."

#. Author of the plugin
#: zinn-migrate.php
msgid "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"
msgstr "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: zinn-migrate.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:57
#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:150
msgid "Move this site to Zinn®"
msgstr "Matsar da wannan shafin zuwa Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:58
msgid "Move to Zinn®"
msgstr "Muruda zuwa Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:68
msgid "You do not have permission to do this."
msgstr "Ba ka da izinin yin wannan."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:154
msgid "This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link."
msgstr "Wannan yana tattara komai a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon — fayilolinsa da bayanan bayanan sa — zuwa cikin kundin adana bayanai guda ɗaya, kuma yana ba ku keɓaɓɓen mahada zuwa gare shi. Liƙa wannan mahada cikin ƙaura a Zinn® kuma za mu ja shafin a fadin. Babu wani abu da ake aikawa ko ina anan har sai kun zaɓi raba mahadar."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:168
msgid "You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you."
msgstr "Wataƙila ba ka buƙatar wannan ba. Idan tsohon mai masaukin yanar gizonka ya ba ka FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk ko DirectAdmin, Zinn® na iya ɗaukar shafin kai tsaye da waɗannan bayanan kuma za ka iya tsallake wannanplugin ɗin gaba ɗaya — yana da sauri kuma babu abin da ya rage a baya daga baya. Yi amfani da wannan lokacin da babu wani daga cikin waɗannan da ke gare ka."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:180
msgid "Room on this server"
msgstr "Wuri a kan wannan uwar garken"

#. translators: %s: an approximate size, e.g. "1.4 GB".
#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:191
#, php-format
msgid "This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down."
msgstr "Wannan sabar ba za ta gaya mana adadin sararin da ya rage a rumbun ajiyarta ba, saboda haka ba za mu iya bincika maka ba. Kunshin yana buƙatar kimanin %s. Idan ba ka da tabbas akwai wannan sarari, tambayi mai sabar ɗin kafin ka gina shi — sabar da ta ƙare mata sarari a tsakiyar aiki tana ɗauke da shafin."

#. translators: 1: space required, 2: space free.
#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:197
#, php-format
msgid "The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free."
msgstr "Kunshin yana buƙatar kusan %1$s kuma wannan uwar garken tana da %2$s kyauta."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:206
msgid "Build the package"
msgstr "Gina kunshin"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:208
msgid "Building…"
msgstr "Ana ginawa…"

#. translators: 1: what is being packaged now, 2: files packaged so far, 3: size so far.
#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:213
#, php-format
msgid "Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written."
msgstr "Yanzu ana shiryawa: %1$s. Fayiloli %2$s kawo yanzu, %3$s an rubuta."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:214
msgid "your files"
msgstr "fayilolinka"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:214
msgid "your database"
msgstr "ma'ajiyar bayananka"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:226
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Ci gaba"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:227
msgid "Cancel and delete"
msgstr "Soke sannan ka share"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:238
msgid "Your package is ready"
msgstr "Kunshin ku a shirye yake"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:239
msgid "Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:"
msgstr "Kwafi wannan hanyar haɗin gwiwa sannan ka manna shi a cikin ƙaura ta Zinn®:"

#. translators: %s: the package size.
#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:252
#, php-format
msgid "Size: %s."
msgstr "Girman: %s."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:264
msgid "Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished."
msgstr "Ka dauki wannan hanyar sadarwa kamar kalmar sirri. Duk wanda yake da ita zai iya sauke daukacin shafinka, ciki har da bayanan ajiyarka. Muna goge fakitin da kansa bayan sa'o'i 24 da aka kirkire shi — ka goge shi da kanka da zaran ka gama hijirar shafin."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:273
msgid "Delete the package now"
msgstr "Share fakitin yanzu"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-admin.php:274
msgid "Build it again"
msgstr "Sake ginawa"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-package.php:187
msgid "This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead."
msgstr "Wannan uwar garken ba ta da tsarin ZipArchive na PHP, don haka ba za mu iya gina kunshin a nan ba. Ka roƙi mai masaukin baƙi naka da ya kunna shi, ko kuma a maimakon haka ka yi amfani da fom ɗin ƙaura a kan Zinn® tare da bayanan FTP ko SSH naka."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-package.php:197
msgid "We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable."
msgstr "Ba mu iya ƙirƙirar babban fayil ba a cikin kundin adireshin ku na lodawa, don haka babu inda za a rubuta fakitin. Bincika cewa wp-content/uploads yana da izinin rubutawa."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-package.php:278
msgid "There is no package being built. Start one first."
msgstr "Babu wani kunshin da ake ginawa. Fara guda ɗaya tukunna."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-package.php:284
msgid "We could not open the package file for writing."
msgstr "Ba mu iya buɗe fayil ɗin kunshin don rubutawa ba."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-package.php:366
msgid "We could not write the database export."
msgstr "Ba mu iya rubuta fitar da bayanan ba."

#. translators: %s: the Zinn Digital trade mark, which is not translated.
#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:241
#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:299
#, php-format
msgid "%s — guides and services"
msgstr "%s — jagorori da ayyuka"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:256
msgid "User guides"
msgstr "Jagororin masu amfani"

#. translators: %s: this plugin's name, e.g. "Zinn® Cache".
#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:306
#, php-format
msgid "Read the %s user guide"
msgstr "Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:314
msgid "Hide this"
msgstr "Boye da wannan"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:374
msgid "Zinn® hosting for WordPress"
msgstr "Zinn® hosting don WordPress"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:375
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:381
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "Kasuwar Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:382
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "Sayi da siyar da ingantattun shafuka, yanki (domains), da wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa (link placements), tare da ajiye kudin a amince har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:429
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — hayar mutanen da suka kware a fannin aikinsu"

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-promo.php:430
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya wani aikin kuma bari su yi ciniki."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-updater.php:233
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Dubi bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-migrate-updater.php:288
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta gaza a wajen tantance amincinta kuma ba a shigar da ita ba."
